EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_RsBrendan_1::
	.string "... ... ...\p"
	.string "...Oh, it’s you.\p"
	.string "You wanted to get stronger, so you\n"
	.string "came for the legendary POKéMON\l"
	.string "that’s supposed to be here. That’s\l"
	.string "your story, right?\p"
	.string "Well, that’s not going to happen.\p"
	.string "Because I’m going to get it!\p"
	.string "I’m going to be the world’s greatest\n"
	.string "trainer, so a legendary POKéMON\l"
	.string "would be perfect for me.\p"
	.string "...Well, anyway, I’m getting tired\n"
	.string "of having a wimp like you always\l"
	.string "showing up.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_RsBrendanDefeat::
	.string "...Humph!\p"
	.string "This is why I hate battling wimps.\p"
	.string "There’s no challenge in it.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_RsBrendan_2::
	.string "...Aw, whatever.\p"
	.string "You could never be able to catch a\n"
	.string "legendary POKéMON anyway.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_FirebreatherNedIntro::
	.string "My soul is on fire. I’ll show\n"
	.string "you how hot it burns!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_FirebreatherNedDefeat::
	.string "Still not hot enough...$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_FirebreatherNed::
	.string "In the past, there were these POKéMON\n"
	.string "that ran through grass at super-\l"
	.string "high speed.\p"
	.string "They say that they run like the wind.\p"
	.string "If you run into one in grass, it\n"
	.string "will likely bolt.$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_FirebreatherDickIntro::
	.string "Hey, I’m training secretely here!\p"
	.string "Don’t embarrass me by looking!$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_FirebreatherDickDefeat::
	.string "I burned down to white ashes...$"

EcruteakCity_Interior1_Text_FirebreatherDick::
	.string "I was so into my training that I\n"
	.string "fell down this hole.$"
